    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-definition",
        "moduleId": "intro-and-definition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材中的 default constructor",
        "markdown": "教材指出，如果程序员完全没有声明构造器，Java 会自动补上一个空构造器；例如对 `Person` 类，编译器会生成 `Person()`。这个由编译器补上的构造器就是 default constructor。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000065"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "Default Constructor"
              ],
              "lineStart": 415,
              "lineEnd": 426,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "ac08a9fb3be33263ffca787ccf541a254335e22dc0405e5475c70c630e29d884"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-implicit-need",
        "moduleId": "intro-and-definition",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：为什么需要编译器的兜底",
        "markdown": "`new` 表达式在创建对象时必须调用某个构造器。若类里一个构造器都没有，编译器补一个无参构造器，才能让 `new Person()` 这样的创建语句成立。它不承载业务逻辑，只保证该类型可以被构造。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-generation-rule",
        "moduleId": "generation-rule",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材给出的生成条件",
        "markdown": "生成条件只有一条：类中是否声明了构造器。教材强调，一旦程序员声明了任意构造器，不论参数列表如何，编译器都不会再生成 default constructor。default constructor 只在编译器发现该类没有任何构造对象的方式时才会补上。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000065"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "Default Constructor"
              ],
              "lineStart": 415,
              "lineEnd": 426,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "ac08a9fb3be33263ffca787ccf541a254335e22dc0405e5475c70c630e29d884"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-decision-flow",
        "moduleId": "generation-rule",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "补充：三步判定是否存在 default constructor",
        "markdown": "判断时可以按顺序检查：\n\n1. 类中是否至少声明了一个构造器？\n2. 若没有，编译器会生成一个无参的 default constructor。\n3. 若已经声明一个或多个构造器，则不存在 default constructor，`new` 必须匹配某个已声明构造器的参数。\n\n注意这里看的是“是否声明过任何构造器”，而不是“是否声明过无参构造器”。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-definition",
            "tb-generation-rule"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-no-args-super",
        "moduleId": "default-init-and-chain",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：不接收参数并调用父类构造器",
        "markdown": "default constructor 不接受参数，因为编译器不知道应该给参数填入什么值。教材还指出，Java 中构造器的第一行总是以 `super()` 开始，用于调用父类构造器；如果程序员没有写这一行，编译器会自动补上。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000065"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "Default Constructor"
              ],
              "lineStart": 415,
              "lineEnd": 426,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "ac08a9fb3be33263ffca787ccf541a254335e22dc0405e5475c70c630e29d884"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-field-defaults",
        "moduleId": "default-init-and-chain",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：“空构造器”实际做了什么",
        "markdown": "“空构造器”指方法体里没有自定义语句，而不是对象什么初始化都不做。在 Java 中，它仍会先调用 `super()`，然后实例字段获得该类型的默认值：数值为 `0`，`boolean` 为 `false`，引用类型为 `null`。因此 default constructor 不会给字段赋有业务含义的初值；需要这类初值时，应显式编写构造器。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-no-args-super",
            "tb-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-multiple-inheritance",
        "moduleId": "default-init-and-chain",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "教材：多继承语言中的构造器链",
        "markdown": "在支持多继承的语言里，构造器链会更复杂：可能存在多个父类，单靠一个 `super` 关键字不足以为每个父类指定参数，因此需要显式写出各父类的构造参数，例如 C++ 的做法。若父类只提供带参数的构造器，子类也必须显式链式调用它。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
